  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Harwich Port</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4419 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-harwich-port tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4419\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-mary-ann-simpson/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet the Artist Mary Ann Simpson</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T08:44:21-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 8:44 am\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists – Meet the Artists Series – Mary Ann Simpson – July 6 at the Guild’s Art Gallery. Saturday, July 6, Mary Ann Simpson will have a <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-mary-ann-simpson/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4416 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-art-in-the-park category-events category-news tag-art-in-the-park tag-cape-cod tag-harwich-port\" id=\"post-4416\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/new-season-of-art-in-the-park/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman in a pink shirt holding a painting easel.\" src=\"/media/archive/9902e5ae0c0e83b7e7f07d85ba9344d2d26558e0f23e546f35fd637bddd6b8aa.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/new-season-of-art-in-the-park/\" rel=\"bookmark\">New Season of Art in the Park</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T08:26:47-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 8:26 am\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Art in The Park season kicks off Monday, July 1, 2019. Members of The Guild of Harwich Artists exhibit and sell original artwork in Harwich Port’s Doane Park in what has <a href=\"/news/new-season-of-art-in-the-park/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4088 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-bank-shows category-news tag-cape-cod-5-bank tag-harwich-port\" id=\"post-4088\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/maloney/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"473\" height=\"344\" alt=\"A painting of sailboats docked in the harbor.\" src=\"/media/archive/ae6d620c4440be626cbf6a4e887c0e11b347c3f5654a1d2c0fce5201b94695d5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/maloney/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Maloney Exhibits at Cape Cod 5 Bank</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-01-06T16:12:40-05:00\" title=\"Sunday, January 6, 2019, 4:12 pm\">January 6, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>William J. Maloney, oil and watercolor painter, is the featured Guild of Harwich Artists bank show artist on display during the month of January 2019 in the lobby at Cape Cod 5 Bank, 532 Main St (Route 28), Harwich Port, MA 02646﻿ #ArtAndCommunity #Harwich</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3947 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3947\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"392\" alt=\"A picture of a teepee in a frame.\" src=\"/media/archive/e2325b07094631c7cfe0ba8a3e2febc6f3657fa559d9a197eb0c5621d263b66f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist August 4</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-31T21:17:51-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 31, 2018, 9:17 pm\">July 31, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Would you like to talk art with a master artist? Join Paul Hammersten who will spend the day, Saturday, August 4 discussing such questions as: What is art? Can creating <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3941 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-passport-to-the-arts tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3941\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Three women standing in front of a table with paints on it.\" src=\"/media/archive/bc8c17abbef9ade1c4bb8883a302263adaca3acf408992e7dd60fc16fd579e70.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Busy Saturday in Harwich Port</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-23T14:37:13-04:00\" title=\"Monday, July 23, 2018, 2:37 pm\">July 23, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists hosted “Meet The Artist” with Marion Harcourt on Saturday, July 21. The Art Gallery also held the afternoon reception for the <a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3820 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-paint-the-town tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-wet-sale tag-wychmere-harbor\" id